= MediaWiki substrate =

BITwiki V2 is implemented on MediaWiki. The repository must therefore model the wiki that actually exists rather than allowing convenient filesystem folders to become an invented architecture.

The authoritative runtime signals are [[Special:NamespaceInfo]], [[Special:Version]], the MediaWiki API site information captured in <code>archive-v1/siteinfo.json</code>, and live fidelity checks. Repository structure is a source-control projection of those surfaces; it is not itself the ontology.

